{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 21, "ref": "genesis 34:21", "book": "genesis", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 34, "translation": "\"Orang-orang ini sejahtera terhadap ⟨את⟩ kami; maka biarlah mereka duduk di tanah ini ⟨את⟩ dan berdagang di dalamnya — dan tanah itu, sesungguhnya luas kedua-dua belah tangan di hadapan mereka. Anak-anak perempuan mereka kita ambil bagi ⟨את⟩ kami sebagai isteri, dan ⟨את⟩ anak-anak perempuan kita kita berikan kepada mereka.\"", "tokens": [{"surface": "האנשים", "gloss": "orang-orang"}, {"surface": "האלה", "gloss": "ini"}, {"surface": "שלמים", "gloss": "sejahtera"}, {"surface": "הם", "gloss": "mereka"}, {"surface": "אתנו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ kami"}, {"surface": "וישבו", "gloss": "maka biarlah mereka duduk"}, {"surface": "בארץ", "gloss": "di tanah"}, {"surface": "ויסחרו", "gloss": "dan berdagang"}, {"surface": "אתה", "gloss": "⟨את⟩-nya", "marks": "tanah itu"}, {"surface": "והארץ", "gloss": "dan tanah itu"}, {"surface": "הנה", "gloss": "sesungguhnya"}, {"surface": "רחבת", "gloss": "luas"}, {"surface": "ידים", "gloss": "kedua-dua belah tangan"}, {"surface": "לפניהם", "gloss": "di hadapan mereka"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "anak-anak perempuan mereka"}, {"surface": "בנתם", "gloss": "anak-anak perempuan mereka"}, {"surface": "נקח", "gloss": "kita ambil"}, {"surface": "לנו", "gloss": "bagi kami"}, {"surface": "לנשים", "gloss": "sebagai isteri"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "dan ⟨את⟩", "marks": "anak-anak perempuan kita"}, {"surface": "בנתינו", "gloss": "anak-anak perempuan kita"}, {"surface": "נתן", "gloss": "kita berikan"}, {"surface": "להם", "gloss": "kepada mereka"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T11:07:30.619852425Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}